<title>DUBAI: Kuwait cuts posted oil product prices.</title>
<headline>Kuwait cuts posted oil product prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) has cut its posted product prices with effect December 18, KPC said.</p>
<p>Naphtha, jet and kerosene are cut by four cents to 58 cents a gallon, 80 cents a gallon and 79 cents a gallon respectively.</p>
<p>Gas oil is cut by three cents a gallon to 78 cents.</p>
<p>Medium diesel oil is $1 a barrel lower at $30.50 a barrel.</p>
<p>Fuel oil prices are left unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom +971 4 6071255</p>
</text>
